      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Lovia: Lovia's death",
      "content": "Lovia, wishing Solovei dead, denounced him to Aila as a treacherous murderer and ordered her to thrust a sword through his heart from behind. Solovei had told Aila that Lovia was lying. Aila stabbed Lovia through the back instead, and Lovia died without understanding the betrayal. Aila pointed out that her blood ran red, not the silver of a Frostmoon Scion.",
