    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Letter for Lovia",
        "Sampo Mill"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Lovia",
        "Rotwang"
      ],
      "comment": "Lovia: Letter for Lovia",
      "content": "In this letter in the Sanctum of the Oathbearer, Rotwang reports the Maiden's suicide, claims to share Lovia's wish to wake the Sampo Mill and forge an Elysium for the people of Nod-Krai, and flatters her by saying that even at the court of the Belyi Tsar a lady of such foresight is rare. Revelation's Toll shows he was really seeking to open the gate to a \"pitch-black Elysium\", read as the Abyss. Aila sealed the letter away as evidence.",
